DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The nnvvmmee driver provides support for NVMe, or NVM Express, storage con‐
     trollers conforming to the Non-Volatile Memory Host Controller Interface
     specification.

     Although the NVMe specification provides its own command set, the nnvvmmee
     driver provides access to the storage via a SCSI translation layer.

     Sensor values are made available through the _h_w_._s_e_n_s_o_r_s sysctl(8) inter‐
     face.

